ClaudeOpus4.7_Feedback.md

# Docs site (not needed at build time)
docs/build/
docs/.docusaurus/

# The Dockerfiles themselves (the daemon already has them out-of-band)
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.slim
.dockerignore
